 348:Generated_Source\PSoC5/UART.c ****     *      UART_RX_STS_OVERRUN          Interrupt on overrun error.
 349:Generated_Source\PSoC5/UART.c ****     *      UART_RX_STS_ADDR_MATCH       Interrupt on address match.
